*   **Sergei Korolev:** The de facto head of the Soviet space program who directed the development of the R-7 rocket (the world's first ICBM) and led missions that achieved the first artificial satellite (Sputnik 1), the first human in space (Yuri Gagarin), and the first spacewalk.
